{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 15, :comments ["<b>And all the people.</b> From here until לא תגלה ערותך עליו, its law would be to be written after ולשומרי מצותי, except that He did not wish to interrupt between the statements." "<b>Seeing the voices.</b> According to its plain sense: even regarding something that is not seen but is known to be so, it is fitting to use the language of seeing, as in ראה זה מצאתי אמרה קהלת, and וירא העם כי בשש משה."], :book :exodus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 20, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:59:04.799747518Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}